<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Hills Inds	     15.57    1.67</p>
<p> 2   Telecasters Nqld     15.24    5.25</p>
<p> 3   Schroder Intl	  10.46    2.30</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	10.21    0.96</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 9.68    1.05</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   9.58    0.95</p>
<p> 7   Villa World	     9.48    1.16</p>
<p> 8   MT Leyshon Gold	 9.26    2.70</p>
<p> 9   BT Prop Trust	   9.22    1.77</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	 9.07    1.14</p>
<p>11   Aust Tour		 9.04    0.83</p>
<p>12   Centro Prop	     8.94    2.18</p>
<p>13   Gandel Retail Tr	8.76    0.89</p>
<p>14   Gen Prop Tr	     8.41    2.39</p>
<p>15   Spotless Svc	    8.40    1.31</p>
